OPTION EXPLICIT

GAME WINDOW "Phase 4.2 Asset Publication" SIZE 320 BY 180

DIM WindowImage AS IMAGE

LOAD IMAGE WindowImage FROM "Assets\UI\Window.png"

CLEAR RGB(10, 16, 28)
DRAW IMAGE WindowImage AT 40, 30 SIZE 240 BY 120 FILTER SMOOTH
DRAW TEXT "ASSET PUBLICATION" AT 160, 72 SIZE 18 COLOR WHITE CENTERED

PLAY SOUND "Assets\Audio\Click.wav" ON CHANNEL 1

SHOW SCREEN
WAIT 150 MILLISECONDS

END PROGRAM
